### criar Task
POST http://localhost:8888/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "tarefa",
    "description": "descrição",
    "status": false,
    "id": 0
}

### listar tasks 
GET http://localhost:8888/task

### Listar uma task com id
GET http://localhost:8888/task/9

### Editar Task
PUT  http://localhost:8888/task/9

{
    "title": "tarefa",
    "description": "exemplo",
    "status": true
}

###Editar status task

PUT http://localhost:8888/task/9/status